rget":"显示角色面板（玩家）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4c0921145fc1703c6e33df40a74261a546b8e438096141b42bda5b49fa654519","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"042f12de27571707450d287fa7a1f156fe3c220c13a61ae95e62afcc7f1496e6","logical_entry_identity":"f61f23d10a248d8c1334f0438ecd046ecf73440341d430d646c5c37d2aadc607","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You have learned to create and equip specialist ammunition:\nIncendiary - Shots deal an additional %d%% weapon damage as fire in a radius %d ball. This cannot occur more than once per turn.\nVenomous - Shots deal %0.2f nature damage and inflict numbing poison, dealing a further %0.2f nature damage over 5 turns and reducing all damage dealt by %d%%.\nPiercing - Shots reduce armor and saves by %d for 3 turns, and your physical penetration is increased by %d%%.\nYou can only have 1 type of ammunition loaded at a time.\nThe poison damage dealt, armor penetration and save reduction will increase with your Physical Power.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你学会了制造和装备专门的弹药：\n燃烧弹- 命中后，对目标附近的敌人造成 %d%% 火焰武器伤害，范围最大为 %d，每回合最多一次。\n剧毒弹- 命中后，对目标造成 %0.2f 自然伤害并感染麻痹毒素，在 5 回合内造成 %0.2f 自然伤害并削弱其 %d%% 的伤害。\n穿甲弹- 命中后，使目标的护甲和豁免减少 %d，持续 3 回合，你的物理穿透增加 %d%%。\n同时只能装备一种弹药。\n毒素伤害、护甲和豁免削减受物理强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2b2798691d4c247f949af7715f1ec864ce95e28594bbcbda5083ec3b247257e8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"04353a43d829e7b3fdcbf889a28492de5a7d8b75fe4a4ce3ce562baf675782a5","logical_entry_identity":"6f706207473714d05083cd2ec7230fae0bfb5e7dfea67619e0f6dfa57f3c0e1c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"misc","source_tag":"talent category","target":"杂项"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f38428b4ef4b88406923409f1b52c3549f089b59a8cd7734f6d64eb95a10cbff","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0439832fab183f56ee0f5f018c623ff744503a9ff18f1794035af5d81b9f85ea","logical_entry_identity":"8741c7f17e16a0977f5f34e57191ea63f5bf2a53ea09a945e3adf27d0aa72ddb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":" of w